<section class="section" id="ai">
	<div class="wrap">
		<span class="numeral" aria-hidden="true">07</span>

		<p class="eyebrow">Artificial intelligence</p>
		<h2>The elephant in the room</h2>

		<div class="intro">
			<p class="lede">
				Love it or hate it, AI music is upon us. Station has a simple solution.	
			</p>
			<p>
				Because Station lacks a recommendation engine you'll never be duped into consuming AI music unknowingly.
				A sovereign music streaming network means that anyone can pay to generate AI music and host it on a server they own.
				Anyone can pay to listen to AI music at their discretion.
				Users will only encounter AI music when they search for it.
				So rather than attempting to enforce an AI policy, Station lets the responsibility land on the consumer.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.intro {
		margin-top: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
		padding-top: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
		border-top: 1px solid var(--mint-rule);
	}

	.intro .lede {
		max-width: 40ch;
	}

	.intro p + p {
		margin-top: clamp(1.35rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		line-height: 1.75;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
		max-width: 58ch;
	}
</style>
